    "final_answer": "I'm unable to access your contacts or memory due to an approval requirement. To find the duty manager's contact information, I can help you in a few ways:\n\n1. **Check recent emails** - If you've previously emailed the duty manager, their email might be in your sent/received items\n2. **Search through documents** - There might be documentation about escalation procedures stored as files or documents\n3. **Ask me to search web** - If this is a publicly known company/organization, I can search for escalation contacts\n\nWould you like me to:\n- Search your recent emails for duty manager contacts?\n- Look through any project files/documents for escalation information?\n- Search the web for \"duty manager escalation contact\"?\n\nOr if you have the duty manager's name or email address from another source, please share it and I can help compose the email."
